{"id":"a4bd0f61521c55c7","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-borel-reduction.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive2 Borel Reduction","display":"df-zfc-descriptive2-borel-reduction — ZFC Descriptive2 Borel Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-borel-reduction","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive2-borel-reduction","58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-reduction"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive2-borel-reduction — ZFC Descriptive2 Borel Reduction","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-borel-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-borel-reduction</span><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive2-borel-reduction — ZFC Descriptive2 Borel Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3169dc41990b4bbe\" href=\"?note=3169dc41990b4bbe\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\Sigma_X),(Y,\\Sigma_Y)\">\\((X,\\Sigma_X),(Y,\\Sigma_Y)\\)</span> (standard Borel spaces with their Borel sigma-algebras, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(E\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq Y\\times Y\">\\(F\\subseteq Y\\times Y\\)</span> (equivalence relations)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to Y\">\\(f:X\\to Y\\)</span> (Borel map parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2BorelReduction}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2BorelReduction}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}\">\\(\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}\\)</span>（标准 Borel 空间谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3169dc41990b4bbe\" href=\"?note=3169dc41990b4bbe\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\)</span> (equivalence-relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelReduction}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelReduction}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}borel\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2BorelReduction}_S(f,E,F,X,\\Sigma_X,Y,\\Sigma_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(X,\\Sigma_X)\\land\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(Y,\\Sigma_Y)\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(F,Y)\\land f:X\\to Y\\land\\forall B\\in\\Sigma_Y\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\Sigma_X)\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x&#39;\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\langle f(x),f(x&#39;)\\rangle\\in F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}borel\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2BorelReduction}_S(f,E,F,X,\\Sigma_X,Y,\\Sigma_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(X,\\Sigma_X)\\land\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(Y,\\Sigma_Y)\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(F,Y)\\land f:X\\to Y\\land\\forall B\\in\\Sigma_Y\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\Sigma_X)\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x&#39;\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\langle f(x),f(x&#39;)\\rangle\\in F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}borel\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelReduction}_S(X,\\Sigma_X,Y,\\Sigma_Y,E,F,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2BorelReduction}_S(f,E,F,X,\\Sigma_X,Y,\\Sigma_Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}borel\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelReduction}_S(X,\\Sigma_X,Y,\\Sigma_Y,E,F,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2BorelReduction}_S(f,E,F,X,\\Sigma_X,Y,\\Sigma_Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-reduction</code> is merged here; it used the same Borel reduction relation with reordered parameters.</li>\n<li>仅有任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数并不足以表达描述集合论中的 Borel reducibility；两个载体现在显式要求为标准 Borel 空间。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"3169dc41990b4bbe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(X,\\Sigma_X),(Y,\\Sigma_Y)$ (standard Borel spaces with their Borel sigma-algebras, see [[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"3169dc41990b4bbe","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}$（标准 Borel 空间谓词，见 [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S$ (equivalence-relation predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\Sigma_X),(Y,\\Sigma_Y)","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq Y\\times Y","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2BorelReduction}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelReduction}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}borel\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2BorelReduction}_S(f,E,F,X,\\Sigma_X,Y,\\Sigma_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(X,\\Sigma_X)\\land\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(Y,\\Sigma_Y)\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(F,Y)\\land f:X\\to Y\\land\\forall B\\in\\Sigma_Y\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\Sigma_X)\\land\\forall x,x'\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x'\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\langle f(x),f(x')\\rangle\\in F)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}borel\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelReduction}_S(X,\\Sigma_X,Y,\\Sigma_Y,E,F,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2BorelReduction}_S(f,E,F,X,\\Sigma_X,Y,\\Sigma_Y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":2288,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-322","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-descriptive2-borel-reduction]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"